          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi wi̱i̱kiɛn tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ce̱tnikɛ gua̱th ti ca päl ɛ ji̱ Iwi kɛnɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor, tëë ci kɛn kɛ ba̱ny piny kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, bi kɛn diaal te ni baaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
